	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Raspberry Pi RP2354A QFN-60 7x7. Land per ${OPENDRONE_LIB}/datasheet/RP2350.pdf (RP2350 Datasheet) s14.1.2 Figure 144 'Recommended PCB Footprint for the RP2350 QFN-60 package' (pdf p1329): pads 0.20 x 0.875 at 0.40 pitch, 7.75 outer / 6.00 inner, EP 3.40; RP2354A uses the same QFN-60 (s14.3); pin 1 top-left, counter-clockwise. pad centres (6.00 + 0.875) / 2 = 3.4375; EP paste 3 x 3 windows 0.95 (70 %), the figure gives none; EP vias on the board (P5). Corrected copy of OpenDrone:QFN-60_L7.0-W7.0-P0.40-TL-EP3.4 (same frame), F.Fab body, no component silk; spec hardware/tools/land_specs/QFN-60_L7.0-W7.0-P0.40-TL-EP3.4_W.json")
